Description: discover and manage installed desktop applications
 Housekeeper provides a searchable application inventory with installation
 sources, versions, software sizes, launcher icons and management actions.
 It can install applications through PackageKit and Flatpak, import AppImages
 and create website launchers for native Chrome or Chromium.
 .
 DEB ownership is read from dpkg. Native updates and removal remain in the
 system package manager. Flatpak operations require the optional integration.
 GNOME Shell is not required; other desktops support launcher icon overrides
 without changing the GNOME icon theme.
